WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:10.263
&gt;&gt;&gt; Breaking news.

00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:10.830
Just two days after we learned

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:11.931
of the department of energy's

00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:12.798
admittedly low confidence

00:00:12.932 --> 00:00:13.766
assessment that the pandemic

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.868
began with a lab leak in Wuhan,

00:00:16.269 --> 00:00:18.504
China, tonight on fox, FBI

00:00:18.638 --> 00:00:20.273
director Christopher Wray

00:00:20.273 --> 00:00:20.907
publicly acknowledged the FBI

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.841
believes it too, with what

00:00:22.275 --> 00:00:24.443
sounds like higher confidence.

00:00:24.577 --> 00:00:27.179
&gt;&gt; The FBI has for quite some

00:00:27.313 --> 00:00:29.749
time now assessed that the

00:00:29.882 --> 00:00:32.285
origins of the pandemic are most

00:00:32.418 --> 00:00:34.687
likely a potential lab incident

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.289
in Wuhan.

00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:38.524
Let me step back for a second.

00:00:38.658 --> 00:00:40.426
The FBI has folks, agent,

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.297
professionals, analysts,

00:00:44.297 --> 00:00:46.299
virologists, microbiologist, et

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:48.668
cetera, who focus specifically

00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:49.535
on the dangers of biological

00:00:49.669 --> 00:00:51.203
threats which include things

00:00:51.337 --> 00:00:54.307
like novel viruses like covid

00:00:54.307 --> 00:00:56.309
and the concerns that in the

00:00:56.309 --> 00:00:58.477
wrong hands, some bad guys, a

00:00:58.611 --> 00:00:59.478
hostile nation state, a

00:00:59.612 --> 00:01:00.980
terrorist, a criminal, the

00:01:01.113 --> 00:01:02.315
threats that those could pose.

00:01:02.348 --> 00:01:05.685
So here you're talking about a

00:01:05.818 --> 00:01:08.821
potential leak from a Chinese

00:01:08.955 --> 00:01:09.956
government-controlled lab that

00:01:10.323 --> 00:01:11.223
killed millions of Americans.

00:01:11.357 --> 00:01:13.159
And that's precisely what that

00:01:13.292 --> 00:01:16.329
capability was designed for.

00:01:16.429 --> 00:01:18.331
&gt;&gt; Director Wray added that the

00:01:18.331 --> 00:01:18.864
bureau's investigation

00:01:18.998 --> 00:01:20.333
continues, and the Chinese

00:01:20.399 --> 00:01:23.636
government, in his view seems to

00:01:23.769 --> 00:01:26.806
be trying to obfuscate the work

00:01:26.939 --> 00:01:27.106
here.

00:01:27.239 --> 00:01:28.374
David Culver joins us with more.

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:29.742
What is the significance of

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:30.743
director Wray's comments?

00:01:30.876 --> 00:01:32.345
Do you expect any official

00:01:32.345 --> 00:01:32.845
Chinese reaction?

00:01:32.979 --> 00:01:33.779
Obviously they have swatted this

00:01:33.913 --> 00:01:34.413
down before.

00:01:34.547 --> 00:01:35.815
&gt;&gt; They're good at doing that

00:01:35.948 --> 00:01:36.849
and they'll continue likely to

00:01:36.983 --> 00:01:37.383
do it again.

00:01:37.516 --> 00:01:38.417
It's a significant given that

00:01:38.551 --> 00:01:40.353
these are his first public

00:01:40.353 --> 00:01:41.687
comments on the FBI's

00:01:41.821 --> 00:01:43.222
investigation, and he reiterates

00:01:43.356 --> 00:01:44.390
that there is moderate

00:01:44.523 --> 00:01:46.392
confidence from the agency's

00:01:46.525 --> 00:01:47.226
investigation that this started

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:48.361
as a lab leak.

00:01:48.361 --> 00:01:49.261
I think what we would love to

00:01:49.395 --> 00:01:51.197
see is some of the Intel that

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.698
actually details why they come

00:01:52.832 --> 00:01:53.633
to that conclusion.

00:01:53.766 --> 00:01:56.469
But he held back on specifics,

00:01:56.602 --> 00:01:58.504
as of most of these agencies as

00:01:58.638 --> 00:02:00.039
they have come forward with

00:02:00.373 --> 00:02:00.740
their conclusions.

00:02:00.873 --> 00:02:02.708
As far as the Chinese and how

00:02:02.842 --> 00:02:03.576
they're going to go forward with

00:02:03.709 --> 00:02:04.877
this, it's been playbook at this

00:02:05.011 --> 00:02:06.612
point and some is literally

00:02:06.746 --> 00:02:07.713
scripted from the foreign

00:02:07.847 --> 00:02:08.381
ministry.

00:02:08.381 --> 00:02:09.281
At this point they've probably

00:02:09.415 --> 00:02:10.783
memorized it, and that is to say

00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:12.918
that the U.S. Is trying to smear

00:02:13.052 --> 00:02:14.387
China, that this is politicizing

00:02:14.387 --> 00:02:15.054
the issue.

00:02:15.187 --> 00:02:16.822
They often go back to that

00:02:16.956 --> 00:02:17.423
science-based approach.

00:02:17.556 --> 00:02:18.758
They say that's the way this

00:02:18.891 --> 00:02:20.393
should be done, through science.

00:02:20.393 --> 00:02:22.395
The issue with what is while the

00:02:22.395 --> 00:02:23.295
W.H.O. Initially said after

00:02:23.429 --> 00:02:26.399
their field visit in 2021 that

00:02:26.399 --> 00:02:27.800
it's highly unlikely it started

00:02:27.933 --> 00:02:29.902
in a lab, the W.H.O. Also asked

00:02:30.036 --> 00:02:31.170
to go back.

00:02:31.303 --> 00:02:32.872
And if China really wants to

00:02:33.005 --> 00:02:34.540
pursue that science-based

00:02:34.673 --> 00:02:36.509
approach, you think they would

00:02:36.642 --> 00:02:37.710
say all right, come back in.

00:02:37.843 --> 00:02:38.911
Anything you need, we'll

00:02:39.045 --> 00:02:39.245
provide.

00:02:39.378 --> 00:02:40.513
They've done the opposite.

00:02:40.646 --> 00:02:42.548
They've said no to the data and

00:02:42.681 --> 00:02:43.382
no to another visit.

00:02:43.516 --> 00:02:45.851
&gt;&gt; The data is really critical.

00:02:45.985 --> 00:02:47.653
They have not provided the data

00:02:47.787 --> 00:02:50.456
that scientists would need to

00:02:50.589 --> 00:02:51.323
really understand exactly and

00:02:51.457 --> 00:02:53.092
zero in on the origin.

00:02:53.225 --> 00:02:54.427
&gt;&gt; That's been the issue going

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.461
back to the start of this.

00:02:55.594 --> 00:02:56.829
Now they argue that they have

00:02:56.962 --> 00:02:58.864
provided enough to allow the

00:02:58.998 --> 00:02:59.865
international science community

00:02:59.999 --> 00:03:01.067
to figure out what steps they

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.935
need to move forward, and they

00:03:03.069 --> 00:03:05.104
argue that even played into some

00:03:05.237 --> 00:03:06.439
of the vaccine creation.

00:03:06.539 --> 00:03:07.907
But the reality on the ground

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.208
has been that there has just

00:03:09.341 --> 00:03:10.943
been a wall after wall for a lot

00:03:11.077 --> 00:03:12.445
of these scientists and

00:03:12.445 --> 00:03:13.646
researchers who pointed out that

00:03:13.779 --> 00:03:15.214
they were not there as

00:03:15.347 --> 00:03:15.648
investigators.

00:03:15.781 --> 00:03:17.083
They wanted to stress that.

00:03:17.216 --> 00:03:19.085
And that's kind of a way to ease

00:03:19.218 --> 00:03:20.619
in from the Chinese side in

00:03:20.753 --> 00:03:21.353
particular, because they don't

00:03:21.487 --> 00:03:24.090
want the Chinese to think that

00:03:24.457 --> 00:03:24.824
they're really trying to convict

00:03:24.957 --> 00:03:25.624
them on something.

00:03:25.758 --> 00:03:26.692
The Chinese hated this idea that

00:03:26.826 --> 00:03:28.627
they will potentially be seen as

00:03:28.761 --> 00:03:30.463
to be blamed globally for this.

00:03:30.529 --> 00:03:32.832
But the reality has stood that

00:03:32.965 --> 00:03:34.467
any information that would get

00:03:34.467 --> 00:03:37.636
us conclusive evidence as to how

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:39.171
this started has really not come

00:03:39.305 --> 00:03:40.506
from the Chinese, and that

00:03:40.639 --> 00:03:41.340
approach doesn't seem to change

00:03:41.474 --> 00:03:41.974
any time soon.

00:03:42.108 --> 00:03:43.242
&gt;&gt; It's interesting that China

00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:45.177
keeps saying this shouldn't be

00:03:45.311 --> 00:03:45.578
politicized.

00:03:45.711 --> 00:03:47.513
They're clearly aware in some

00:03:47.646 --> 00:03:48.747
quarters of political divide

00:03:48.881 --> 00:03:49.849
that exists over the lab leak

00:03:49.982 --> 00:03:50.549
theory in the United States.

00:03:50.683 --> 00:03:51.317
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah.

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.752
They're acutely aware of that.

00:03:53.886 --> 00:03:54.787
And they watch closely how it's

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.555
played out here in Washington

00:03:56.689 --> 00:03:57.123
and particular.

00:03:57.256 --> 00:03:57.823
They love that.

00:03:57.957 --> 00:03:59.725
They love to see the division

00:03:59.859 --> 00:04:02.094
over the discussion of how it

00:04:02.495 --> 00:04:03.028
started and Democrats going

00:04:03.162 --> 00:04:04.163
against Republicans on this.

00:04:04.497 --> 00:04:05.798
That's really what they try to

00:04:05.931 --> 00:04:07.833
foster more than anything else.

00:04:07.967 --> 00:04:09.235
And they are hoping that that

00:04:09.368 --> 00:04:10.870
will continue to distract

00:04:11.003 --> 00:04:11.203
things.

00:04:11.337 --> 00:04:12.071
The problem that they're seeing

00:04:12.505 --> 00:04:13.939
here is there is bipartisan

00:04:14.073 --> 00:04:15.674
support to be tough on China and

00:04:15.808 --> 00:04:17.309
the party and state media sees

00:04:17.443 --> 00:04:18.177
this in particular.

00:04:18.511 --> 00:04:19.645
And they hope for another

00:04:19.778 --> 00:04:20.646
campaign cycle more than

